      "display_name": "Abandoned Orphan",
      "display_only_not_execution_authority": true,
      "display_timing_or_category": null,
      "full_description": "## Abandoned Orphan\n\nYou grew up in alleys, ruins, kitchens, docks, roadside shrines, or abandoned courtyards. No one gave you a place. You survived by noticing danger early, hiding what mattered, and taking what you needed before someone stronger took it first.\n\n### Ability Scores\n\nChoose one:\n\n- Increase one of the following ability scores by 2: Dexterity, Wisdom, Charisma.\n- Increase two of the following ability scores by 1 each: Dexterity, Wisdom, Charisma.\n\n### Skill Proficiencies\n\nYou gain proficiency in Deception and Sleight of Hand.\n\n### Tool, Language, or Trade Proficiencies\n\nYou gain proficiency with thieves' tools and one language of your choice.\n\n### Background Sphere and Talent\n\nChoose one:\n\n- **Scoundrel Sphere.** You gain the Scoundrel sphere and the **Grifter’s Hands** (`GRIFTER’S HANDS`) talent.\n- **Scoundrel Sphere.** You gain the Scoundrel sphere and the **Hidden Tool Cache** (`HIDDEN TOOL CACHE`) talent.\n- **Equipment Sphere.** You gain the Equipment sphere and the **Hidden Plates** talent.\n\n### Starting Equipment\n\nYou begin with worn common clothes, a small knife, thieves' tools, a bedroll, a hidden pouch, three days of poor rations, and one keepsake from the life you lost or never had.\n\n### Origin Insight Options\n\nSuggested Origin Insights include:\n\n- Street-Hardened\n- Hunger Memory\n- No One Saves You\n- Quick Hands\n\n### Social Hook\n\nYou know how people treat the powerless. Other outcasts may recognize you as one of their own, but officials, guards, and respectable families rarely assume the best of you.\n\n---",
      "full_description_source": "rules_selection_packet",
      "one_line_description": "An abandoned survivor trained in deception, sleight of hand, thieves’ tools, and concealed preparations.",
      "record_hash": "44725b1474a5c837d75acd8d7bbd301685d8a7d63d409c60f13b92ef28ad1ac2",
      "record_id": "tianxia.background.abandoned_orphan",
