      },
      "display_name": "Ability Score Improvement or Cultivation Insight",
      "display_only_not_execution_authority": true,
      "display_timing_or_category": "Feature",
      "full_description": "At CL4, CL8, CL12, CL16, and CL19, choose one of the following:\n\n- **Normal Ability Score Improvement:** Increase one ability score by 2, or increase two different ability scores by 1 each. No score can exceed the maximum allowed by your current Realm.\n- **Cultivation Insight:** Choose one Cultivation Insight from the Central Cultivation Insights catalogue for which you meet every prerequisite. Gain its printed benefit and increase one ability score listed in that Insight's **Ability Increase (Level Selection)** entry by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.\n\nAn Insight gained through a non-level source does not grant its ability increase unless that source explicitly says otherwise. Background ability increases and Origin Insights are separate benefits. If an Insight grants a new Sphere, it also grants the normal free first talent received whenever a character learns a new Sphere.",
      "full_description_source": "rules_selection_packet",
      "one_line_description": "At designated levels, choose an Ability Score Improvement or a Cultivation Insight.",
      "record_hash": "2d916dea2de0662f0ccb97fdce14d86229c0300c0eab9b80decd5ebca5859101",
      "record_id": "tianxia.path.qi_cultivation.feature.ability_score_improvement_or_cultivation_insight",
