        "combat_execution": "UNSUPPORTED",
        "gm_display": "NOT_ATTEMPTED"
      },
      "display_name": "Qi Armor",
      "display_only_not_execution_authority": true,
      "display_timing_or_category": "Reaction",
      "full_description": "## CL5 — Qi Armor\n\n**Reaction**  \n**Trigger:** You are hit by a ranged attack roll.  \n**Cost:** 2 Qi\n\nGain +3 AC until the start of your next turn, including against the triggering attack.\n\nActivate after learning that the attack hit and before damage is applied.\n\nQi Armor applies to:\n\n- Ranged weapon attacks.\n- Ranged spell attacks.\n- Ranged cultivation attacks.\n- Ranged Sphere attacks.\n- Recorded Art attack rolls.\n- Forged Technique attack rolls.\n- Immortal Art attack rolls.\n- Item attack rolls.\n- Formation attack rolls.\n\nQi Armor does not apply to:\n\n- Melee attacks.\n- Reach attacks classified as melee.\n- Saving throw effects.\n- Automatic damage.\n- Environmental damage.\n- An effect without an attack roll.\n\nAt CL10, Qi Armor costs 1 Qi.\n\n---",
      "full_description_source": "rules_selection_packet",
      "one_line_description": "Spend Qi after a ranged attack hits to gain +3 AC through the start of your next turn.",
      "record_hash": "0c6118f17f3ce3b5466356358768c3028ea23157527fe7df9936d40b4c607b3f",
      "record_id": "tianxia.path.qi_cultivation.feature.qi_armor",
      "section": "path_features",
      "source": {
        "anchor": "record:tianxia.path.qi_cultivation.feature.qi_armor",
